Z||000009||FieroLisa||08-31-2001||01:17 PM||||The sad thing is, you'll probably get more for it from a non-fiero enthusiast. I had my 86 gold coupe up for sale, with perfect paint, 87 fascias, perfect interior, clean good running engine, 5 speed, 4 cyl... No one with a Fiero already wanted, they told me I'd be lucky to get $1,500 out of it.  Anyway I sat it out on the road and ended up getting $2,300 cash on the spot for it from some redneck. I know he woulda paid more if I hadn't written 2300 in shoe polish on the windshield  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/fierolisa.gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A><P>AIM: FieroLisa||||reg||1
